config SAMSUNG_EXYNOS9820_MCU_IPC
	tristate "Samsung Exynos 9820 CP mailbox (S10)"
	depends on ARCH_EXYNOS && OF
	default n
	help
	  Support the Samsung MCU_IPC mailbox used by the Exynos 9820 CP on
	  Galaxy S10-family devices. This is the legacy Samsung mailbox API
	  consumed by the S5000AP SIPC modem stack; it is not a generic mailbox
	  controller driver.

	  Keep this disabled unless the matching S10 CP mailbox node and its
	  interrupt mapping have been reviewed in the device tree. Enabling this
	  driver clears AP-generated pending mailbox interrupts when it probes.
